<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers slow, Choice steers steady. Heifers and Select steers $0.50 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter steers: Mostly Choice 2-4 1150 -1300 lbs 65.00-66.50. Select 62.00-65.00</p>
<p>Slaughter heifers: Largely Choice 2-4 900-1250 lbs 63.50-66.50, only reputation fed at outside price.  Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
